	"system": {
		"description": "<p>… Okay. Come on. You know someone had to write it. Just bear with me.</p><p>While rarely covered within standard fantasy tropes, gun-fu is exceptionally common in traditional media, particularly science fiction, after the creation of the Matrix, Equilibrium, Wanted, and a dozen other gun-fu films. And with the release of the Voidrunner’s Codex we now have access to lots of lovely sci-fi and sci-fantasy rules and rulings!</p><p>So this one’s for all those players who want to be as cool as John Wick, pistol whipping their way through the dungeon. For those who wish to adapt this concept to a more fantastical or steampunk sort of design, simply replace light firearms with hand crossbows for the same effect.</p><p><strong>Table: Gun Fu Master</strong></p><table border=\"1\"><colgroup><col><col></colgroup><thead><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>Level</td><td>Features</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>3rd</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.EEDmAX3IirT3oiOb]{Bonus Proficiency} @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.GnTOjhUAV4d5EaAR]{Gun Kata}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>6th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.sabNeBVak0QWIrE2]{Big Iron Strike}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>11th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.mZSgHTS4hBzjAmoX]{Gunfighter's Stance}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>17th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.3YYojQIJMcn9uUvE]{Bullet Hell}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
